现在您有了一个 Next.js 应用程序的基本结构。要使其与 GPT-4 协同工作，您需要在 `utils/generate.js` 中实现 `generateCustomResume` 和 `generateAnswers` 函数，利用 GPT-4 API 生成定制简历和答案。

要使用OpenAI API来生成自定义简历和答案，您首先需要安装`openai`包：
```bash
npm install openai
```
接下来，设置API密钥进行身份验证。 您可以在OpenAI帐户设置中找到API密钥。 将API密钥添加到项目的根目录中的`.env.local`文件中：
```makefile
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```
确保将`.env.local`添加到`.gitignore`文件中以防止暴露您的API密钥。
现在，更新您的`pages/api/generate.js`文件以将API密钥传递给实用程序函数：
```javascript
const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY;
const generatedResume = await generateCustomResume(cv, jobDescription, apiKey);
const generatedAnswers = await generateAnswers(cv, jobDescription, questions, apiKey);
```
接下来，更新您的`utils/generate.js`文件以使用OpenAI API：
```javascript
import openai from "openai";
async function generateGPTResponse(prompt, apiKey) {
  openai.apiKey = apiKey;
  try {
    const response = await openai.Completion.create({
      engine: "davinci-codex",
      prompt: prompt,
      max_tokens: 150,
      n: 1,
      stop: null,
      temperature: 0.5,
    });
    if (response.choices && response.choices.length > 0) {
      return response.choices[0].text.trim();
    } else {
      throw new Error("No response from the API");
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error("Error generating GPT response:", error);
    throw error;
  }
}
export async function generateCustomResume(cv, jobDescription, apiKey) {
  const prompt = `Create a custom resume based on the following CV and job description:
  CV: ${cv}
  Job description: ${jobDescription}`;
  const generatedResume = await generateGPTResponse(prompt, apiKey);
  return generatedResume;
}
export async function generateAnswers(cv, jobDescription, questions, apiKey) {
  const parsedQuestions = questions.split(",").map((q) => q.trim());
  const generatedAnswers = await Promise.all(
    parsedQuestions.map(async (question) => {
      const prompt = `Considering the following CV and job description, provide a well-structured and concise answer to the question:
      CV: ${cv}
      Job description: ${jobDescription}
      Question: ${question}`;
      const answer = await generateGPTResponse(prompt, apiKey);
      return { question, answer };
    })
  );
  return generatedAnswers;
}
```
这些实用工具函数利用OpenAI API根据用户输入生成自定义简历和答案。 `generateGPTResponse`函数处理API调用和错误处理，而`generateCustomResume`和`generateAnswers`函数创建GPT的适当提示。
`generateAnswers`函数考虑到多个问题，解析它们并单独生成答案以防止上下文不清的回答。 温度设置为0.5以平衡创意和连贯性。
请记得在GPT-4引擎可用时将`davinci-codex`引擎替换为它。

